# THROUGH THE DRAGON GATE: up Grant Ave from Bush at 6 m/s, an ollie through the gate's middle opening
# (over the road, between its two middle pillars), taken off south of the pillars and landed north of them.
# Then a teleport up Grant: the landing after it is not an air from the gate (it paid the gate again
# before physics phase 31: a teleport left the last takeoff where it was).
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 teleport 265.8 658 -1.0 353.7
cmd 3 set skater.vel.x -0.66
cmd 3 set skater.vel.y 5.96
hold ollie 117..147
cmd 400 teleport 248.5 763.6 7.95 350
run 500
expect event pop within 146..150
expect event gap{id=dragon_gate,gap=THROUGH THE DRAGON GATE,points=500} within 258..264
expect event land{quality=clean} within 258..264
expect event gap{id=dragon_gate} count == 1
expect no event bail
expect no event wallplant
expect event goalComplete{id=dragongate} within 258..264
